WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.610
He finally showed up.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.730
I'm Raimon Jr. High's captain, Shindou Takuto.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.690
And these are...

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.620
The Raimon Eleven!

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:23.900
What do you think you're doing on these sacred grounds?

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:25.750
Soccer.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.170
Can't you tell by looking?

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.270
Show some manners, first-year.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.760
Don't get high and mighty just because you beat the second team!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.000
Beat them?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.930
I just played around with them a bit.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:47.210
Coach, who is this?

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.480
He's likely someone sent in from Fifth Sector.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.460
Fifth Sector?

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.130
What did you come here to do?

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:59.570
I've been ordered to reform Raimon's soccer club.

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:02.630
The whole lot of you are getting pitched with the rest of the trash.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:03.450
What?

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.260
Let me introduce you.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:10.460
This is the new...

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:13.920
Raimon Eleven.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.160
They're your replacements.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:20.370
No way!

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:00.820
Our replacements?!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.120
<i>We're</i>  the true Raimon Eleven!

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:05.880
Yeah.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:06.790
I've been waiting for you.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.790
Now let's get the real show started.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:14.370
I don't see any reason for us to play against a gang that's just causing trouble.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:18.560
Or are you telling me that you made the proper arrangements for an official match?

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:23.940
You don't seem to understand the situation you're in.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.030
Listen up.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.870
This isn't a request.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.120
It's an order.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.120
How dare you...

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:54.120
Then shall we start?

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:55.790
Captain.

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:59.850
Hey, something big's happening at the soccer club!

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.430
Yeah, they're having a match!

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:02.670
Let's check it out!

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:04.950
Soccer?

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:07.720
Could it be...?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.380
Well, isn't this royal.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.110
Just what you'd expect from a school famous for its soccer.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.400
Leave out the small talk.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.240
Furukabu-san, please handle the referee duties.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:28.220
Then we'll start the practice match.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.450
Raimon's soccer club versus...

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.250
Um...

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.970
For the time being...

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:38.340
Call them the Black Knights.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:38.790
Err...

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.050
I'm Kuroki.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.090
You can consider me as their coach.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.730
Now start the match.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:48.570
Okay then.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:52.980
We will now begin the match between Raimon's soccer club versus the Black Knights!

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.700
May both sides fight fairly.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:57.480
Yes, sir!

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.440
Of course.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:03.280
What's happening here?

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:05.920
Shindou.

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:09.120
Why do you think the syndicate is intervening with Raimon's Rank A team?

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:10.980
I'm not sure.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:14.130
But that guy insulted Raimon...

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.500
...and the team.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.460
I won't forgive him.

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.580
The Black Knights.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:24.030
Looks like they're the members Fifth Sector sent in.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:29.180
This'll be a shoo-in for Kudou's dismissal.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.940
Wow, this place is huge!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.860
I wonder if I'll be able to find him here.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:42.680
Are you a new student?

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.130
Yes!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.070
Um, what's happening here?

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:50.070
A family feud in the soccer club.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.180
Family feud?

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.700
Tenma?

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:56.160
Why?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:00.170
Amazing.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:03.530
Tenma!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:08.720
Raimon's first team versus the unknown team, the Black Knights!

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:12.440
It looks like this fight will determine which team gets to be Raimon's soccer club!

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:16.770
Oh, it seems we've got new students here as well, so I'll introduce myself.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.600
I am the commentator here.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.600
Kakuma Ayumu!

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:25.980
I'm in charge of running all of the commentary for Raimon's matches!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:28.400
I see.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.530
The kickoff will begin soon!

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:38.880
Let's do it, Minamisawa-san.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:39.630
Yeah.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.790
Let's see what they can do.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:46.300
Raimon makes the first attack!

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:47.920
Minamisawa-san!

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.840
Shindou makes a centering!

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.180
Minamisawa makes a direct shoot!

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.350
Can the goalkeeper Tetsuoda catch it?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.350
They did it!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.300
He blocks it!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.980
Tetsuoda firmly catches it!

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:03.990
What?!

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:05.230
Of course.

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.370
Tsurugi makes a pass!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.420
This is amazing!

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:16.790
They keep making direct passes in mid-air!

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:21.150
Kizaki takes the ball and is in position to shoot!

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:27.050
Goal!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.660
The Black Knights take the leading point!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.350
Goalkeeper Sangoku couldn't even move!

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.450
It's a sudden upturn!

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.300
They passed to each other in mid-air...

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.930
And got to the goal in the blink of an eye!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:38.890
What <i>is</i>  this?

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.360
A-Amazing...

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.850
Sangoku-senpai!

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.760
I let my guard down. Sorry.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.270
Hear that?

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.720
"I let my guard down", he said.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.550
Now then.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.160
What'll you do, Captain?

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:55.630
These guys are tough.

00:07:55.970 --> 00:08:00.230
I can't believe they got a point off Sangoku-senpai that quickly...

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.870
The match resumes!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.130
Raimon goes without the leading point, so now what will they do?

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.370
Here it comes!

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:13.840
Stop him!

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.640
I won't let you through!

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:17.300
Oh no!

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.060
Is he going to use that move?

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:35.920
Death Sword!

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:40.320
You won't get the better of me!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:50.460
Burning Catch!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.320
Sangoku!

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:03.140
I have my doubts about this school's reputation.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.830
This is pathetic.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.450
What was that just now?

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:10.000
Their movements are beyond what humans can do!

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.990
We haven't lost yet.

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:12.980
Get a grip, guys!

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.650
What a disaster!

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:27.380
Raimon is getting hit one-sidedly with goals!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.730
At this rate, Raimon...

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:32.840
I've gotta do something!

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:36.170
Coach!

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.510
At this rate, everyone in the team will...

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.470
Can't we do something?

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:40.880
Coach!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.130
It's not the coach's job to "do something".

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:47.050
It's the player's job.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:48.440
The player's?

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:52.770
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:53.530
Yes, sir?

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:55.610
Put on one of the spare uniforms.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.340
I thought you were a candidate to join the club?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.320
Yes, sir, but...

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.410
I'm testing you.

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:06.200
Switch players!

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:08.750
In place of Minamisawa Atsushi...

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.130
...is Matsukaze Tenma!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.310
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.670
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:28.460
Switch players!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:30.370
In place of Minamisawa Atsushi...

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:31.500
...is Matsukaze Tenma!

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.160
That's crazy!

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.110
You want to test him in a match like <i>this</i> ?

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.540
Oh, who's that wearing Raimon's uniform?

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.830
It looks like a new member candidate!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.620
What are Coach Kudou's intentions behind this?!

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:51.370
Tenma?

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.900
He's benching me?

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:57.960
Minamisawa-san, I'm sure the coach has an idea about this.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.920
Sure, then you can handle the rest.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.700
Why me?

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:12.770
Um, thank you for helping me out earlier.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:14.510
I'll do my best!

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:19.200
Why did the coach bring him in?

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:21.460
What're you thinking?!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:24.310
He hasn't even taken the steps to join the club yet!

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:28.680
Otonashi, didn't you sense anything from him when you watched him earlier?

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:33.810
Matsukaze's eyes when he stood up against Tsurugi...

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:36.210
Somehow, they resembled <i>that</i>  man.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.080
Endou-san, you mean?

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:44.440
The new player, Matsukaze Tenma, has entered the pitch!

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:47.230
Just what does Coach Kudou have planned?

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.090
This is Raimon.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:52.350
I've always wanted to come here.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.440
I'm standing on its grounds right now.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.720
I'm wearing the uniform I've always admired.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:03.610
At this rate, they'll take over the soccer club... and soccer itself!

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:06.110
I've got to do something!

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:07.990
You again?

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:12.620
It'll work out.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.580
It'll work out somehow!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.380
I'll protect the soccer I love!

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:32.980
Damn it!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.520
Protect soccer?

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.240
Don't make me laugh.

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:45.940
What's wrong?

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:48.580
Is that the extent of your love for soccer?

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.370
Damn it...!

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:57.050
That's the end of the first half!

00:12:57.050 --> 00:13:01.300
The first half ends with the Black Knights having a one-sided lead!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.940
I'm sorry, Captain...

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:12.710
I'm not of any help even when I'm on the field.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.500
But...

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:18.440
I don't want them taking over the soccer club!

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.260
Calm down.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.030
I don't want to hand over the soccer club either.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.440
But those guys aren't easy pickings.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.650
It hurts to say, but they've got the upper hand on us.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.260
This is how Fifth Sector does things.

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:33.020
Fifth Sector?

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:35.620
Oh yeah, you didn't know about them yet.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.490
Ten years ago, Japan became number one in the world for youth soccer.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:44.440
Because of that, soccer's popularity increased,

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:49.610
and the strength of the soccer team came to be what determined a school's reputation in society.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:52.760
The stronger it is, the more prestigious it gets. 
The weaker it is, the further it falls.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:57.940
Soccer is what determines the value of school and people these days.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.440
Soccer is...?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:03.530
You came to Raimon, like the rest, for its strong soccer reputation, right?

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.320
Reputation?

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.710
No, that's not it!

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:11.160
It's been my life-long dream to play soccer at Raimon!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.470
Life-long dream, huh...

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:22.680
You're the only one saying things like that.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.970
Results are everything.

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:28.090
If your soccer is weak, people will see you as worthless.

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:35.730
The soccer management syndicate Fifth Sector was created to provide salvation from this situation.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:39.170
Even so, for Fifth Sector to go this far...

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:43.330
They manipulate victory and defeat at will, under the name of management.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.110
Retribution awaits you if you try to retaliate.

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:54.240
Right now, they manage every aspect of each school's teams and even the development of the players.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:15:02.130
Will we ever be able to bring back that passionate soccer Endou-san and the others used to play?

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.510
This can't even be called soccer now.

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:08.880
Soccer is... under someone's control.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.170
This is soccer?

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:13.280
No way...

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:15.100
But...

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.360
We still have an honest match every now and then.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.140
When those happen, we can play soccer as much as we want.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:23.850
The second half is starting!

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:26.400
What will Raimon do with the lead taken from them?!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.480
Captain!

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:31.720
What's wrong?

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.280
Giving in so early?

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:36.240
I can't let it end here.

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:37.490
Damn it!

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.250
Why not give up?

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.170
You guys are going out with the rest of the trash.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.260
The Black Knights are overwhelming the second half too!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:00.220
You guys can't win against us.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.520
Your soccer club's finished!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.270
Finished?

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.760
The soccer club's not finished!

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:12.160
I won't hand over Raimon's soccer club to anyone!

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.030
Never!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.760
Then I'll just <i>take</i>  it from you!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.710
How cruel...

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:24.200
Do you understand now?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:27.650
This is all there is to the Raimon you admired.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:28.800
It's hopeless.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:33.550
They're going to take over the soccer club even if they have to injure us.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:37.000
Sorry, but I...

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:39.760
Wait, Mizumori!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:40.950
Where are you going?

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.390
I'm quitting.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.870
Don't go, Mizumori!

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:45.030
Mizumori!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.400
Damn it, at this rate...

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.140
They'll all break down...

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.820
Everyone will... break down...

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.020
You can have it.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:00.910
Now, bring it.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.580
Here I go!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:06.790
What?

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:12.760
That dribble...!

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:15.460
He's pretty good.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.550
He practices more than anyone else when it comes to dribbling.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.760
Even when he couldn't get in a team, he'd practice all by himself.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.670
Hey, pass it here!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:29.770
What?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.720
What's he doing?

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:32.850
Pass it over here!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:34.930
Here!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:37.680
Hey!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.200
Why isn't he passing?

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.580
But he's kind of impressive!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.700
Tenma-kun, what're you doing?

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:48.830
He'll probably try to keep the ball until time's up.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:55.340
By not handing over the ball to anyone, none of his teammates will get attacked.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:59.010
Then Tenma-kun's doing it to protect everyone?

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:02.560
Think it'd work that easily?

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:07.020
You've got nowhere to run now.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.140
Tsurugi-kun.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.190
Break him down.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.530
Understood, sir.

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:17.200
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.420
Your face ticks me off.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.510
Soccer is a waste of time!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:32.040
What is that?

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.580
Is that...?!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:34.670
An Avatar!

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:36.130
W-What's this?

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:42.050
Appearing on the field is the big talk among soccer players, the Avatar?!

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:49.190
This is my Avatar, Sword Saint Lancelot.

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.600
Coach Kudou, this is...

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.340
The spiritual energy people create is usually invisible to the eye,

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:59.820
but when that power is mastered, it reveals itself in a visible form.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:01.410
What the heck is that?

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.370
There really are Avatar users!

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.740
It wasn't just an urban legend?

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.300
Amazing...

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.510
It's too early to be surprised!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.810
Tenma-kun!

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.700
This isn't soccer.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:27.120
Make them stop!

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.310
No can do.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.030
The match isn't over yet.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.400
Coach...

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.050
I-I'm fine.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:43.910
Let me play through to the end.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:45.580
Matsukaze...

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:47.980
Don't overdo it, you won't last!

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:50.680
I want to play to the very end.

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:55.250
If... If I make it to the very end...

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:57.380
I'm sure we'll find a way through!

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:02.330
Take this!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.520
Matsukaze!

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.990
You're so reckless...

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:13.270
Is that it?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.440
I want to play!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:18.860
I want to play soccer with everyone!

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:22.450
You'd go so far for that...?

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.330
Please.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.570
Captain...

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:29.500
Don't give up on soccer.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.680
Matsukaze...

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:36.260
Captain, please.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.790
Even I...

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.310
Why?

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:49.390
Why?!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:53.250
I can't even protect my teammates.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.890
What makes me a captain?!

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:56.400
This thing is just...!

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:57.810
Captain...

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:00.820
Damn it!!

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:07.110
What?

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:07.780
That's...!

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:55.450
The dramatic induction ceremony!

00:22:55.450 --> 00:22:58.680
Will the sun rise tomorrow for the soccer club I've admired?

00:22:58.680 --> 00:23:03.480
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Raimon Soccer Club Under Destruction!!

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:05.520
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:17.990
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:26.020
If you make it to the very end, you'll surely find a way through!

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:26.600
That's all!
